      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "PM 是通知接收者；原文没有在此指定 PM 为通知执行者。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote": "必须通知 PM", "clause_id": "c1", "occurrence": 0, "context_anchor": null}
